WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.168
Thank you very much.

00:00:02.569 --> 00:00:04.537
I think you're
in the Christmas spirit.

00:00:04.671 --> 00:00:06.206
Are you in the--
Is that what this is?

00:00:06.306 --> 00:00:09.108
I think everybody is.
I tell you, I--

00:00:09.342 --> 00:00:11.010
Yesterday, I found
my elf on a shelf

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:12.545
passed out next to my vape pen.

00:00:12.645 --> 00:00:14.614
(LAUGHTER)

00:00:14.747 --> 00:00:15.748
Something's going on.

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:18.418
But... And it's Hanukkah.

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:19.819
How about
any of you celebrating...

00:00:19.952 --> 00:00:21.120
All right.

00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:23.122
(CHEERING, APPLAUSE)

00:00:23.255 --> 00:00:24.957
So those people, you know,

00:00:25.024 --> 00:00:27.026
those people like in the Midwest
who don't know--

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:31.097
No, I'm kidding.
There's Jews everywhere.

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:33.199
Endangered everywhere,
but they're everywhere.

00:00:33.332 --> 00:00:35.167
(LAUGHTER)

00:00:35.301 --> 00:00:37.136
But Hanukkah is a celebrate--

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:39.372
it's a festival celebrating
the Jews' recovery

00:00:39.472 --> 00:00:42.074
of the city of Jerusalem
in the second century,

00:00:42.308 --> 00:00:43.409
before Christ.

00:00:43.676 --> 00:00:46.145
Or as the Palestinians say,
"Get off our land."

00:00:46.245 --> 00:00:50.983
(LAUGHTER, APPLAUSE)

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:54.820
That issue--
That issue is not going away.

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:57.156
Did you see what happened
with the college presidents
this week?

00:00:57.289 --> 00:00:59.625
The presidents of the--
of Harvard--

00:00:59.759 --> 00:01:02.562
Harvard University
and UPenn and MIT

00:01:02.662 --> 00:01:07.033
were hauled before Congress,
and yelled at for good reason,

00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:10.770
for refusing to call
the genocide of Jews,

00:01:10.937 --> 00:01:13.339
on campus,
bullying or harassment.

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:16.075
Misgender a Jew, get thrown off
for that in a minute.

00:01:16.208 --> 00:01:19.979
-(LAUGHTER)
-Not the other thing.

00:01:20.145 --> 00:01:24.784
-(APPLAUSE)
-So...

00:01:25.184 --> 00:01:27.386
And there may be protests
here this weekend

00:01:27.486 --> 00:01:28.988
because the president
is in town.

00:01:29.121 --> 00:01:30.723
Isn't that great?
When the president...

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:32.692
-(CHEERING)
-No.

00:01:33.826 --> 00:01:35.695
Really? You think that's good?

00:01:37.029 --> 00:01:40.099
Are you out on the...
I'll say this.

00:01:41.233 --> 00:01:44.570
The only other time in this town
an 81 year old fucks up traffic

00:01:44.670 --> 00:01:47.140
is when they're driving a white
Camry in the passing lane.

00:01:47.273 --> 00:01:50.176
(LAUGHTER)

00:01:50.376 --> 00:01:52.745
No, it's not good
when the president's here.

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:58.785
But the Republicans had
another one of their debates
without Trump.

00:01:58.885 --> 00:02:01.320
-This is getting...
-(LAUGHTER)

00:02:01.454 --> 00:02:04.390
Now there's four of them
left on the island, and-- and--

00:02:04.523 --> 00:02:06.125
(LAUGHTER)

00:02:06.292 --> 00:02:07.160
It's just sad.

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:08.627
It's like a battle of the bands

00:02:08.694 --> 00:02:11.397
between the other women
in Destiny's Child...

00:02:11.464 --> 00:02:17.537
(LAUGHTER, APPLAUSE)

00:02:18.504 --> 00:02:20.539
...and the surviving members
of The Doors.

00:02:20.639 --> 00:02:21.674
You know, it's just--

00:02:24.777 --> 00:02:27.980
But no, there is some crazy
right wing shit out there.

00:02:28.114 --> 00:02:29.115
I got to tell you,

00:02:29.315 --> 00:02:33.253
the State of New Hampshire
is proposing a ban on abortion

00:02:33.353 --> 00:02:36.355
that starts at 15 days
after gestation.

00:02:36.455 --> 00:02:40.760
You're not even pregnant yet.
Fifteen days, not weeks, days.

00:02:40.927 --> 00:02:42.462
And they asked
the author of this bill,

00:02:42.595 --> 00:02:43.796
"What were you thinking?"

00:02:44.097 --> 00:02:46.132
And he said, "I don't know,
I never got past second base."

00:02:46.232 --> 00:02:47.100
(LAUGHTER)

